UPDATE companies SET description='RDO Equipment Co. operates a John Deere dealership in Hazen, North Dakota, serving the central region of the state. The location is part of the broader RDO Equipment Co. network, which describes its culture as rooted in tradition and values, though the founding year and ownership structure for this specific store are not disclosed on the page.

The Hazen store sells and services John Deere agriculture equipment, lawn and garden equipment, compact utility tractors, and utility vehicles such as the Gator series. Its service capabilities include machine repair and inspections, field technician dispatch, precision agriculture technology support, custom hydraulic hose assembly, bulk oil and fluid delivery, and after-hours emergency support. The company maintains a parts inventory of 650,000 items accessible through an online account system, with fulfillment via parts route trucks and convenient drop-off locations.

The dealership also supports precision agriculture adopters through dedicated technology specialists.

RDO Equipment Co. emphasizes a relationship-driven approach, stating that its focus is on building trust rather than simply closing sales.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Machine Service and Repair", "Field Service Technicians", "Machine Inspections", "Precision Agriculture Technology Support", "Custom Hydraulic Hose Building", "Bulk Oil and Fluid Delivery", "After-Hours Support", "Connected Support", "Curbside Pickup", "Parts Drop Off", "Parts Route Trucks", "Text Alerts for Parts and Service", "Service Scheduling"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Landscaping", "Grounds Maintenance"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["John Deere Compact Utility Tractors", "John Deere Gator Utility Vehicles", "John Deere Harvest Equipment", "John Deere Lawn and Garden Equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["After-hours support available any day, any time", "Custom hydraulic hose building as a one-stop shop", "Field service technicians who travel to the customer site", "Text alerts for parts and service order completion", "Parts route trucks for delivery and drop-off pickup"], "facts_used": ["Location: Hazen, ND -> /", "John Deere dealer selling agriculture, lawn/garden, compact utility tractors, utility vehicles -> /", "Services: machine repair, field technicians, precision ag support, custom hydraulic hose, bulk oil delivery, after-hours support -> /", "Parts inventory: 650,000 parts -> /", "Parts fulfillment: route trucks, drop-off locations -> /", "Customer focus: relationship-driven, trust over sales -> /", "Store manager: Mike Miller; Aftermarket sales: Loren Henke -> /", "Connected support and text alerts -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "At this location, we sell and service John Deere agriculture equipment, lawn and garden equipment, compact utility tractors, and utility vehicles.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "