company?", "founded_year": "1988", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='repower-by-solar-universe-northeast-pa' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='RL Hudson was founded in 1980 in Tulsa, Oklahoma, as a distributor of rubber O-rings to the regional oil industry. The company expanded nationally by 1985, added an in-house engineering department in 1991, and began manufacturing mandrel-formed hoses in 1996. Plastic injection molding capabilities were added in 1999, and operations relocated to Broken Arrow, Oklahoma, in 2004. Leadership includes Chairman Rick Hudson and CEO Jason Hudson.

The company specializes in custom plastic injection molding, rubber component manufacturing, and value-added unit assembly. Its plastic molding uses scientific (decoupled) injection molding on presses from 85 to 4,000 tons with real-time AuthenTIG monitoring. Rubber capabilities include injection, transfer, and compression molding, plus wrapped and extruded formed hoses. In-house tooling design, machining, and maintenance support production, while plastic welding covers ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, and vibration methods. A 2024 expansion added a high-volume automated assembly line.

Customers include material handling OEMs, outdoor power equipment manufacturers, and on-highway engine makers who rely on the firm for part consolidation, metal-to-plastic conversions, and complex multi-component assemblies.

The company emphasizes end-to-end solutions, combining design engineering, error-proofing, and rigorous quality control under one roof. Its integrated molding and assembly model aims to deliver faster turnaround, tighter quality control, and cost-effective part consolidation with a zero-defect mentality.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 14001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection molding (scientific/decoupled molding)", "Rubber injection molding", "Rubber transfer molding", "Rubber compression molding", "Mandrel-formed hose manufacturing", "Extruded formed hose manufacturing", "Plastic welding (ultrasonic)", "Plastic welding (spin)", "Plastic welding (hot-plate)", "Plastic welding (vibration)", "Pad printing", "Unit assembly", "Automated assembly", "Tooling design", "Tool machining", "Tool maintenance", "Check gage fabrication", "Error-proofing systems", "Custom fixture design", "Design engineering support", "Material selection guidance", "Metal-to-plastic conversion support", "Prototype development", "Production scaling"], "industries": ["Automotive", "HVAC", "Medium & heavy trucks", "Outdoor power equipment", "Powersports", "Agriculture", "Appliances", "Marine", "Power generation", "Waterworks", "Heavy equipment", "Material handling", "On-highway engine"], "materials": ["Thermoplastic resins (commodity to ultra-high performance)", "Custom rubber compounds"], "equipment": ["Injection molding presses 85-4000 tons", "AuthenTIG real-time process monitoring system", "In-house tooling machining equipment", "Plastic welding equipment (ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, vibration)", "Pad printing equipment", "High-volume automated assembly line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Scientific injection molding (decoupled process) for consistency and reduced cycle times", "In-house tooling design, machining, and maintenance", "Integrated plastic and rubber molding with assembly under one roof", "Plastic welding via ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, and vibration methods", "End-to-end design engineering support and error-proofing"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1980 in Tulsa, OK -> /about-us", "Relocated to Broken Arrow, OK 2004 -> /about-us", "ISO 9001 certification 2004 -> /about-us", "ISO 14001 certification 2019 -> /about-us", "IATF certification 2023 -> /about-us", "Plastic injection molding presses 85-4000 tons -> /capabilities", "AuthenTIG real-time monitoring -> /capabilities", "Rubber injection, transfer, compression molding -> /capabilities", "Mandrel-formed and extruded hoses -> /capabilities", "Plastic welding (ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, vibration) -> /capabilities", "Pad printing added 2023 -> /about-us", "Automated assembly line expansion 2024 -> /about-us", "Industries served listed on home page -> /", "Leadership names -> /about-us", "Scientific injection molding described -> /", "End-to-end solutions described -> /", "In-house tooling design, machining, maintenance -> /capabilities", "Design engineering support -> /capabilities", "Material selection guidance -> /", "Metal-to-plastic conversion support -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "RL Hudson is a trusted U.S. manufacturer specializing in custom plastic injection molding, rubber components and value-added unit assembly.", "founded_year": "1980", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='rl-hudson' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='RSP Supply operates from North Salt Lake, Utah, as a supplier of industrial automation and electrical components. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

In addition to distribution, RSP Supply runs a custom fabrication shop that builds control panels to customer specifications and modifies enclosures with cutouts, mounting hardware, and accessories. The company also provides engineering support for industrial automation systems and procurement services for hard-to-find parts.

