UPDATE companies SET description='Raeed & Sons operates from a storefront at 1105 South 12th Street in Bismarck, North Dakota. The family-owned shop opened in May 2013 when Raeed Douri, a technician with over thirty years of electronics experience, started the business to give broken devices a fair shot and treat customers like family.

The shop repairs a wide range of electronics: smartphones (iPhone, Samsung, Pixel), tablets (iPad, Galaxy Tab, Surface), laptops (MacBook, ThinkPad, Dell, HP), desktop computers (Windows and Mac), automotive engine control units and body modules, and industrial printed circuit boards. Services include screen and battery replacement, charge-port repair, water-damage recovery, hardware upgrades, custom PC builds, virus removal, full diagnostics, component-level ECU rebuilds, and PCB repairs such as capacitor replacement, IC reflow, and trace repair. Free diagnostics are offered on every device, and most repairs are completed in under an hour.

Customers include individual consumers with damaged phones or laptops, automotive owners needing ECU module repairs, and industrial clients with faulty control boards or power supplies. The shop serves walk-in traffic without appointments and has built a local reputation reflected in a 100% recommendation rate on Facebook and an A+ Better Business Bureau rating.

Douri founded the business on the principle of providing the attention and service one would expect from a friend, aiming to send every customer home happier than they arrived.', certifications=ARRAY['BBB A+ Accredited']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Smartphone screen replacement", "Smartphone battery replacement", "Charge port repair", "Water damage repair", "Tablet screen replacement", "Laptop screen replacement", "Keyboard replacement", "SSD upgrades", "Data recovery", "Virus removal", "Custom PC builds", "Hardware upgrades", "Full diagnostics", "ECU component-level rebuild", "Blown driver replacement", "PCB capacitor replacement", "IC reflow", "Trace repair", "Free diagnostics"], "industries": ["Consumer electronics", "Automotive electronics", "Industrial electronics"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Most repairs done in under an hour", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free diagnostics on every device", "Most repairs completed in under an hour", "Walk-ins welcome with no appointment needed", "Family-owned with 30+ years of technician experience", "A+ BBB accredited and 100% recommended on Facebook"], "facts_used": ["Location: 1105 S 12th St, Bismarck, ND -> /", "Founded: May 2013 -> /", "Owner: Raeed Douri, 30+ years experience -> /", "Ownership: Family-owned -> /", "Services: smartphone, tablet, laptop, desktop, ECU, PCB repair -> /", "Specific repairs: screen, battery, charge port, water damage, hardware upgrades, custom builds, virus removal, diagnostics, ECU component-level, PCB capacitor/IC reflow/trace -> /", "Free diagnostics, most repairs under an hour -> /", "Walk-ins welcome, no appointment -> /", "BBB A+ accredited, 100% Facebook recommendation -> /", "Industries served: consumer, automotive, industrial electronics -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Family-owned shop fixing phones, tablets, laptops, PCs, ECUs & circuit boards.", "founded_year": "2013", "