UPDATE companies SET description='Rainier Woodworking Co operates from a facility at 2615 South 80th Street in Tacoma, Washington. The company has served the Greater Puget Sound region for many years, producing cabinetry for local designers and dealers. Its roots are in the Pacific Northwest, where it has built a reputation for locally made wood products.

The shop manufactures a superior line of cabinetry sold exclusively through professional kitchen and bath designers and dealers along the West Coast. Production focuses on custom solutions built to client specifications, with an emphasis on heirloom-quality wood construction. The company also offers a design collaboration process, creating products from a client’s vision or delivering finished pieces.

The company also works directly with design professionals to develop custom pieces.

Rainier Woodworking highlights its commitment to fair pricing, working within client budgets and timelines. The company also stresses sustainable material sourcing, noting a deep regard for the trees that supply its wood, and offers a proprietary project-tracking app called RW CabTracker.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet manufacturing", "Design collaboration", "Project tracking via RW CabTracker app"], "industries": ["Kitchen and bath", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Works within customer budgets and timelines", "Locally made in the Greater Puget Sound area", "Heirloom-quality cabinetry built to last a lifetime", "Offers RW CabTracker app for project tracking", "Cabinetry sold exclusively through professional designers and dealers"], "facts_used": ["Location: Tacoma, WA -> /", "Manufactures cabinetry sold through designers and dealers -> /", "Serves Greater Puget Sound area -> /", "Offers RW CabTracker app -> /", "Emphasizes heirloom-quality wood products -> /", "Fair pricing and budget collaboration -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Rainier Woodworking manufacturers a superior line of cabinetry that is exclusively sold through professional designers and some of the best kitchen & bath dealers in west coast", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='rainier-woodworking-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Ramco Automotive, based in Miami, Florida, was founded in 2007 by industry veterans with 40 years of combined experience. The company began as an independent manufacturer and distributor of electrical and electronic replacement parts for motor vehicles.

The company produces a range of sensors and components including crankshaft position sensors, idle air control valves, camshaft position sensors, fuel pressure regulators, coolant temperature sensors, ignition control modules, ignition coils, and knock detonation sensors. Ramco operates an online platform that serves distributors and retailers, offering both its own RAMCO brand and products from other aftermarket manufacturers. The catalog complies with ACES and PIES data management standards.

Ramco serves the automotive aftermarket, original equipment (OE), and original equipment service (OES) markets. Its customer base includes distributors and retailers across the United States, Latin America, Europe, and the Middle East.

The company emphasizes honesty, quality, reliability, and timely delivery. Its mission is to be the independent supplier to the automotive aftermarket by providing high-quality products, competitive pricing, and strong customer service while operating in an environmentally responsible manner.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Manufacturing of electrical/electronic replacement parts", "Distribution of automotive sensors and parts", "Online catalog with ACES/PIES compliance", "Cross-reference/interchange search", "International shipping", "Dedicated technical support"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Original equipment (OE)", "Original equipment service (OES)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Independent manufacturer and distributor of electrical/electronic replacement parts", "Online platform with ACES and PIES data compliance", "International shipping to over 50 countries", "Money-back guarantee", "Dedicated aftermarket specialists for cross-reference and support"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2007 -> /about-us", "Located in Miami, Florida -> /about-us", "Manufacturer and distributor of electrical/electronic replacement parts -> /about-us", "Focus on automotive aftermarket, OE, OES markets -> /about-us", "Founders have 40 years experience -> /about-us", "Expanded to US, Latin America, Europe, Middle East -> /about-us", "Sells to distributors and retailers via online platform -> /about-us", "Complies with ACES and PIES data standards -> /about-us", "Products include crankshaft position sensor, idle air control valve, camshaft position sensor, fuel pressure regulator, coolant temperature sensor, ignition control module, ignition coil, knock detonation sensor -> /about-us, /", "International shipping to over 50 countries -> /", "Money-back guarantee -> /", "Dedicated support -> /", "Cross-reference search -> /", "Mission and values (honesty, quality, reliability, tim