UPDATE companies SET description='Rengo Packaging, Inc. operates from Kapolei, Hawaii, where it has served the local packaging market for over 50 years. The company emphasizes its Hawaiian roots with the tagline “Manufactured in Hawaii. For all of Hawaii.”

