UPDATE companies SET description='Renick Valley Meats operates from Renick, West Virginia, where in 2022 Jesse Zimmerman and Anna Gajewski acquired the existing Countryside Meat Processing facility. The family-owned business rebranded to reflect its ties to the valley and its commitment to serving area farmers and families.

The company provides custom and commercial processing for beef, pork, lamb, goat, and yak, offering services that include commercial slaughter, on-farm slaughter, hand-blended sausage seasoning, and custom labeling. A West Virginia Department of Agriculture inspected facility handles the work, and a retail shop sells seasonal cuts sourced from the owners'' farm and neighboring producers.

Primary customers are West Virginia and Virginia livestock producers who need state-inspected processing to sell meat within the state, as well as local households purchasing retail cuts or curated meat boxes. The 2024 commercial license expanded the firm''s ability to process animals for resale, strengthening the regional food chain.

The founders frame the venture around connecting communities with locally raised meat through ethical handling, eco-conscious operations, and personalized butchery that accommodates rare or custom cuts. Their stated mission emphasizes sustainability, humane treatment, and keeping the food supply close to home.', certifications=ARRAY['West Virginia Department of Agriculture (WVDA) inspected','WVDA commercial meat processing license']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom butchering to specification", "Commercial slaughter and processing", "On-site/on-farm slaughter", "Hand-blended sausage seasoning", "Custom labeling", "Retail meat sales (seasonal cuts)", "Meat box/bundle assembly"], "industries": ["Meat processing", "Custom meat processing", "Commercial slaughter", "Retail meat", "Agriculture"], "materials": ["Beef", "Pork", "Lamb", "Goat", "Yak", "Sausage seasoning"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% locally sourced meat from family-owned farms", "Family-owned and operated business", "Hand-blended sausage seasoning", "WVDA-compliant on-farm livestock slaughter", "Eco-friendly meat processing practices", "Personalized butchery and rare/custom cuts"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2022 by Jesse Zimmerman and Anna Gajewski -> /about-us", "Family-owned, state-inspected processor in Renick, WV -> /", "Custom processing for beef, pork, lamb, goat, yak -> db", "Commercial slaughter, on-site slaughter, hand-blended sausage seasoning, custom labeling -> /", "Obtained commercial meat processing license from WVDA in 2024 -> /about-us", "Serve local farmers and families in West Virginia and Virginia -> /about-us", "Eco-friendly, ethical handling practices -> /", "Retail meats from own farm and local partners -> /", "Meat boxes/bundles offered -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "As a family-owned, State inspected processor in Renick, WV, we specialize in personalized butchery f