UPDATE companies SET description='Renmar DME Inc. operates from Bow, New Hampshire. The business traces its roots back more than 27 years when Mark Reynolds founded Renmar Health Care Products; he retired in January 2019 after the company for over two decades. In January 2019, Alison Theriault and Jonathan Bergin acquired the business and renamed it Renmar DME Inc. Both came from a large global manufacturing company where they specialized in producing components for medical devices, bringing that operational experience to the DME sector.

The company sells and rents a broad range of durable medical equipment, including manual and power wheelchairs, complex rehab power wheelchairs with tilt and recline, power-assist wheelchairs, scooters, hospital beds (fully electric and low-bed options), bath safety products, patient lifts, lift recliners, and specialty cushions. It also provides equipment repair and wheelchair cleaning services, professional seating assessments, and free wheelchair evaluations at its facility or the client''s home. All rental items are offered in standard and bariatric sizes, with next-business-day delivery available. Certified staff handle complex rehab technology selection and training.

Renmar serves individuals with diverse healthcare needs, caregivers, and healthcare facilities across New Hampshire and the surrounding region. Its customer base includes those requiring mobility solutions, post-surgical recovery aids, bariatric equipment, and complex rehab technology.

Renmar emphasizes service as its primary differentiator, stating that service is why customers choose and recommend the firm. It highlights the availability of bariatric sizes across all rental products as a unique offering, along with on-site repairs, detailed cleaning and sanitization, and certified expertise in complex rehab equipment.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Durable medical equipment sales", "Durable medical equipment rental", "Equipment repair", "Wheelchair cleaning and sanitization", "Professional seating assessment", "Complex rehab technology assessment and training", "Delivery and setup", "Bariatric equipment provision"], "industries": ["Durable Medical Equipment", "Healthcare", "Mobility Equipment", "Rehabilitation", "Home Healthcare"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Next business day delivery for rental equipment", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All rental products available in standard and bariatric sizes", "Next business day delivery for rental equipment", "Free wheelchair assessments at facility or home", "Certified staff for complex rehab technology assessment and training", "On-site equipment repairs and cleaning services"], "facts_used": ["Location: Bow, New Hampshire -> db", "Founder Mark Reynolds, retired Jan 2019 -> /about-us", "Acquired by Alison Theriault and Jonathan Bergin Jan 2019 -> /about-us", "Previous experience in medical device component manufacturing -> /about-us", "Products: wheelchairs, scooters, hospital beds, bath safety, lifts, lift recliners, cushions -> /", "Services: repairs, cleaning, assessments, free evaluations -> /", "Bariatric sizes on all rental products -> /", "Next business day delivery for rentals -> /", "Certified staff for complex rehab -> /", "Industries: healthcare, DME, mobility, rehab, home healthcare -> /, /about-us", "Service emphasis and customer recommendation claim -> /", "Company type: distributor/reseller (sources from manufacturers) ->