UPDATE companies SET description='The business traces its roots to an earlier incarnation as Rockland Wholesale, which occupied a building now home to J. Edward Knight Insurance, and before that a location next door to where CarQuest Auto Parts now stands. The family also operated Shore Save, a former grocery store that once stood where a Rite Aid pharmacy is today.

The company runs a foodservice store just outside downtown Rockland, offering a wide variety of foodservice and drink items for takeaway. It sources from numerous local and out-of-state distributors and can procure specialty items usually within a few days. The operation handles bulk and party orders, allowing customers to place advance orders a week early for weddings, parties, or boat trips, with items set aside for pickup. Curbside service is also available.

Its customer base includes anyone needing foodservice supplies, from professional kitchens to residents planning large gatherings.

