UPDATE companies SET description='Royal Automation & Controls operates in Salt Lake City, Utah, and has served the Wasatch Front since 1957. The branch is part of Consolidated Electrical Distributors (CED), a national network with more than 700 locations, and functions as a wholesale supplier of electrical equipment and automation solutions.

The company stocks a broad range of industrial controls and automation hardware, including variable-frequency drives, PLCs, SCADA platforms, explosion-proof enclosures, push buttons, and switchgear. It provides VFD programming and start-up commissioning, switchgear and lighting quotations, project management support, and a delivery service for local customers.

