UPDATE companies SET description='Runergy Alabama operates a solar module manufacturing plant in Huntsville, Alabama. The facility was established in 2023 when Runergy USA Inc expanded its North American operations, building the state’s first solar panel production facility of its kind dedicated to N-type panel assembly. The company is a subsidiary of Runergy USA Inc, which traces its roots to global photovoltaic technology leadership and research partnerships with institutions such as Fraunhofer-ISE and the University of New South Wales.

The plant produces high-efficiency solar modules using both N-type and P-type solar cells. N-type panels are highlighted for superior low-light performance, maximizing energy output during cloudy conditions and at dawn and dusk. Beyond module manufacturing, Runergy Alabama offers solar project development and installation services, drawing on the parent company’s global experience in large-scale and distributed solar installations.

The company serves the solar energy, photovoltaic, and renewable energy sectors. Runergy’s global project development expertise positions it to support a range of project sizes and configurations.

Runergy Alabama differentiates itself through its first-in-state N-type manufacturing capability, research partnerships with Fraunhofer-ISE and the University of New South Wales, and a stated mission to drive innovation toward carbon neutrality. The facility is described as state-of-the-art, emphasizing meticulous process management and high-efficiency solar solutions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar module manufacturing", "Solar panel assembly", "Solar project development", "Solar installation", "N-type solar cell production", "P-type solar cell production"], "industries": ["Solar energy", "Photovoltaic", "Renewable energy", "Solar power project development"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["First solar panel production facility in Alabama producing N-type panels", "Partnerships with Fraunhofer-ISE and University of New South Wales", "N-type panels with superior low-light performance", "Global leader in solar energy innovation", "State-of-the-art solar module manufacturing facility"], "facts_used": ["Huntsville, Alabama headquarters -> db", "Founded in 2023 -> /about", "First solar panel production facility in Alabama producing N-type panels -> /about, /", "Manufactures high-efficiency solar modules (N-type and P-type) -> /, /about", "Solar project development and installation capabilities -> /about", "Partnerships with Fraunhofer-ISE and University of New South Wales -> /about", "Global leader in solar energy innovation -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "first solar panel production facility in Alabama of its kind producing N-type panels", "founded_year": "2023", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/runergyalabama/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='runergy-a