UPDATE companies SET description='S&W Wire Company operates from Cranberry Township, Pennsylvania, where it was founded in 1988 to meet demand for fast-turnaround production of glass- and Kapton-insulated magnet wire.

The firm manufactures a range of magnet wire products, including enameled wire, polyglass-insulated wire (pure fiberglass yarn wrapped, treated, and heat-fused to the conductor in single or double layers), and seamless hollow conductor tubing. It also provides wire testing services for specification and batch uniformity, custom stocking programs aligned with customer supply-chain schedules, and a respooling service that sells exact lengths without requiring full-reel purchases.

S&W Wire serves magnet-wire buyers of all sizes, from small prototype orders to high-volume production runs, offering both bare and insulated wire in round, square, and rectangular profiles.

