UPDATE companies SET description='SPI Semicon operates from Ogden, Utah, tracing its roots to 1970 when two industry leaders — Semicon Systems and Semiconductor Products — merged to form the company. The combined entity brought together decades of packaging expertise under one roof, establishing a foundation that now spans facilities in the United States and the Philippines.

