UPDATE companies SET description='STS Cable Services, Inc. is based in Charlotte, North Carolina, where it provides professional fiber optic installation services to residential and commercial customers. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or the names of its founders.

Its technicians are described as highly trained and certified, using industry-standard equipment and materials to deploy fiber networks for high-speed internet and enhanced communication capabilities. No facility size, headcount, or annual project volume is published.

