UPDATE companies SET description='SVB Foods, Inc. is headquartered in Martinsburg, West Virginia, where it operates a production facility and fulfillment warehouses. The company traces its origins to a beeyard, growing from that start into a food manufacturing business focused on dressings, sauces, honey, and condiments.

