UPDATE companies SET description='SXTH Element Engineering operates from Spartanburg, South Carolina. The company began in a garage, driven by a small team of automotive enthusiasts who wanted to build performance parts they’d trust on their own vehicles. No founding year or individual founders are publicly disclosed.

Product lines include cold-air intakes (branded CPLT), off-road trail pipes, blow-off valves, turbo inlet pipes, front-mount intercoolers, recovery points, bed MOLLE panels, and ECU calibration kits. Parts are designed in-house, CNC-machined from 304 stainless steel with thick flanges, and validated through on-road and track testing.

SXTH serves the automotive aftermarket, focusing on off-road and performance enthusiasts. The site also lists a ''Dealers of Cali Raised LED'' filter, suggesting a dealer network for complementary lighting products, but SXTH’s primary channel appears direct-to-consumer via its web store.

The company emphasizes intentional design and hands-on validation: every part is developed in-house, tested on the vehicle, and refined until it meets the team’s own standards. A patent-pending magnetic lid on the CPLT intake exemplifies their focus on maintenance ease. Their stated differentiators are zero shortcuts, in-house engineering, real-world testing, and a garage-origin ethos that prioritizes durability and fitment over mass-market compromise.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["In-house product design", "CNC machining", "304 stainless steel fabrication", "Performance testing (dyno, on-road)", "ECU calibration", "Direct-to-consumer fulfillment", "Product development for Toyota, Ford, Hyundai/Kia platforms"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Off-road performance parts", "Overlanding accessories", "Performance intake systems", "Forced induction components"], "materials": ["304 Stainless Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house design and on-road testing", "Patent-pending magnetic lid system on CPLT intakes", "304 stainless steel construction with thick CNC flanges", "Garage-origin, small-team hands-on approach", "Zero shortcuts philosophy"], "facts_used": ["Location: Spartanburg, SC -> db", "Garage origin, small team -> /", "In-house design, on-road testing -> /", "CPLT intake with patent-pending magnetic lid -> /", "304 stainless steel with CNC flanges -> /", "Product lines: intakes, trail pipes, blow-off valves, turbo inlets, intercoolers, recovery points, bed accessories, ECU calibration -> /, /about", "Vehicles served: Toyota Tacoma, Tundra, 4Runner, Land Cruiser, GR Corolla; Ford Bronco; Hyundai/Kia K5 GT, Sonata N-Line, Elantra N -> /", "~97 SKUs listed -> /about", "Free shipping over $499 US -> /", "Dealers of Cali Raised LED filter -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Designed in-house. Tested on-road. Proven e